WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.460
- Hi, I'm Megan from Khan Academy,

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:05.410
and in this video,

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.130
we'll browse through
Khan Academy together.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:10.430
We'll start by logging into the platform,

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:11.263
and then go through

00:00:11.263 --> 00:00:13.673
some of the key navigation
features together.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:18.290
To get started,

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:20.980
go to khanacademy.org and click teachers

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.810
in the center of the screen.

00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:26.790
If you have an existing Khan
Academy account, select login.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.000
If you need to create
a Khan Academy account,

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.550
there are four registration options.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:33.650
Using Gmail, Clever,

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:36.670
Facebook or another email account.

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.010
Now you're ready to get started.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.600
Once you've set up your account,

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:42.500
you'll start on the teacher dashboard.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:45.820
We are now viewing the teacher dashboard,

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.610
which is the homepage for teachers.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:50.460
If you are seeing a different homepage

00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.170
than the teacher dashboard,

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.566
you can adjust your homepage

00:00:53.566 --> 00:00:56.330
to the teacher dashboard in settings.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:00:58.193
Don't worry, we'll get to that soon.

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:02.120
There are a few important
items on this page.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.190
The courses button,

00:01:03.190 --> 00:01:05.370
which shows Khan Academy's content

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.080
organized by subject and course.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:08.980
The search bar,

00:01:08.980 --> 00:01:11.030
which you can use to find content quickly

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:13.110
by name or standard.

00:01:13.110 --> 00:01:14.620
The Khan Academy logo,

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:17.370
it will always take you
to your chosen homepage,

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.760
and the navigation button,

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:21.493
which allows you to access
several other pages.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.680
The navigation button,

00:01:24.680 --> 00:01:26.410
which appears as your username,

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.850
can take you to a few essential locations,

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.490
including the learner homepage,

00:01:31.490 --> 00:01:36.490
teacher dashboard, parent
dashboard and settings.

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:43.360
If you want to edit
your basic information,

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:45.400
you can do this from the settings page

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:48.440
from the dropdown of
the navigation button.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:50.130
From the settings page,

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.770
you can edit basic account information

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.683
like username and primary language.

00:01:57.990 --> 00:01:59.393
Reset your password,

00:02:00.310 --> 00:02:04.180
know which email account
is linked to Khan Academy,

00:02:04.180 --> 00:02:05.750
select your homepage,

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:06.793
and much more.

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.470
It is important to check if the
teacher function is selected

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.870
because only then will you have access

00:02:14.870 --> 00:02:16.233
to the teacher dashboard.

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.160
We're selecting the teacher dashboard

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.070
from the dropdown menu.

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:29.280
If you'd like to learn more
about the learner homepage,

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:32.940
check out our video on
the student experience.

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:34.910
From the teacher dashboard,

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:38.350
you will find three very important tabs.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:42.144
The class tab shows all
of your active classes.

00:02:42.144 --> 00:02:44.100
If you select a class,

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.423
you'll be able to view the
roster, student activity,

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:51.773
mastery progress,

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:56.383
and assignments for that class.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:03.060
We will discuss reports in
more detail in a later lesson.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.860
If we return to the main teacher dashboard

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:10.000
by selecting the Khan Academy
logo at the top of the page,

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:13.060
the second tab you will
see is the students tab

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:15.860
on which you can view the
complete list of students

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.960
who are connected to your teacher account.

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:20.850
This list contains all of the students

00:03:20.850 --> 00:03:23.440
currently associated with
your teacher account,

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.763
regardless of their assigned class.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.820
Finally, from the main teacher dashboard,

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.980
you can access the resources tab,

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:35.400
which brings you to teacher
facing materials on Khan Academy

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.313
and also has a shortcut
to Khan for Educators.

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:44.290
We recognize that along
with your students,

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:46.530
many teachers want to
connect their own children

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.740
to their Khan Academy account.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.230
From the navigation button,

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.490
you can access the parent dashboard

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.100
where parents can add their children

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.370
and create accounts for them,

00:03:56.370 --> 00:03:59.100
in addition to monitoring the
progress they are achieving

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.713
with courses on the platform.

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:08.460
One last and important thing to point out,

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:10.943
where to find additional
help if you need it.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:15.710
By clicking help from the
navigation button dropdown menu,

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:17.380
you have access to a page

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.810
full or resources about Khan Academy.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:22.780
Community advice, and you
can even file a request

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.520
for help from our support team

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.263
to resolve any technical
issues that arise.

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.210
We hope this video helps you

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:32.193
find your way around Khan Academy.

